  "missing_rules": "Negative item/PID codes are nonresponse; retained in raw-code fields, never numeric ratings. Structural missing unused intensity branches do not invalidate a rating. Date strings without 8 digits are missing. Zero/nonfinite weights are retained but flagged ineligible for weighted analysis.",
