  "selection": "All 4240 source rows retained. Paired-count reproduction uses two ratings and two dates. Suggested unweighted eligibility additionally requires September PID partisan, baseline before milestone, follow-up before 2008-11-04 and not milestone day. Weighted eligibility additionally requires positive wgtl10 and valid stratum. These are feasibility flags, not preregistered inclusion decisions.",
  "caution": "Within-person data do not randomize interview timing or eliminate concurrent campaign events. September baseline occurs after the scandal's earlier public history. No effect estimates are calculated.",
